WEBVTT

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.440
Oh no...

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:11.110
My heart is still racing.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:14.610
Don’t go back home to him.

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:19.710
Gosh, Keita, what are you saying?

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:21.360
Don’t tease other people’s wives.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:23.080
Kotoko, I...

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:24.830
See you tomorrow then.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:29.170
You’re home early.

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:31.920
Irie-kun.

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:23.460
Kotoko-san, good morning.

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:24.340
Good morning.

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:26.410
What’s wrong? You look kinda down.

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:28.090
Eh? That’s not...

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:30.120
Kotoko! Tomoko!

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:32.040
Over here!

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:33.880
Good morning.

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:35.490
Thanks for last night.

00:02:35.490 --> 00:02:38.740
That’s good, Moto-chan.
Looks like you’ve recovered.

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:41.760
I’m completely cured after all that crying.

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:43.760
Keita is here already.

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:45.950
Tomoko, sit here.

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:50.700
I’ll give you my support!

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:53.000
I think you and Keita would make a great couple.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.070
What are you talking about?

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:55.720
You know... Well...

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:58.130
You have a crush on Keita, don’t you?

00:02:58.780 --> 00:02:59.990
Seriously?

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:03.650
No, I don’t have any special feelings for him.

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:06.750
But, during the venipuncture...

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:09.280
Don’t you feel sorry for Keita?

00:03:10.050 --> 00:03:13.530
Well, that was because Keita seemed extremely nervous.

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:15.880
So, I thought that it might be worthwhile to draw blood from him.

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:21.500
Come to think of it, you were unusually lively back then.

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.390
Remember? During the autopsy practical.

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:26.600
So, this is the heart?

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:32.990
You can’t judge someone by their looks.

00:03:32.990 --> 00:03:35.310
You got the completely wrong idea, Kotoko.

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:38.240
So, it was like that...

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:40.530
Keita!

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:43.760
I’m going to go to the front.

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:46.630
It seems like my eyesight has been getting worse lately.

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:49.280
Suspicious, isn’t it?

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:51.150
I’m talking about Kotoko and Keita.

00:03:51.150 --> 00:03:53.380
They disappeared together last night, right?

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:56.750
But, Kotoko-san is married.

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:59.320
She’s having an affair.

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:01.680
Hopefully nothing bad happens from it.

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:06.430
Thank you for waiting!

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:09.740
Where’s Kotoko today?

00:04:09.740 --> 00:04:12.390
Ah, she said she wasn’t hungry.

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:14.990
That sure is a rare sight.

00:04:14.990 --> 00:04:17.670
Kin-chan, come help me here for a sec.

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:19.390
Okay, give me a moment.

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:22.400
It’s okay, I’ll help instead.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.260
Your girlfriend sure is a hard-worker.

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:26.360
She’s still clumsy even after all this time.

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:29.540
Chris!

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:37.440
How should I act in front of Keita?

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:42.550
But, if I continue like this, the situation will get even more awkward.

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:45.430
I know! I should just act normal.

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:49.470
Oh, Irie-kun?

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:52.940
Irie-kun!

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:58.780
No way! He ignored me?

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:01.150
Chris, stay strong! Chris!

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:02.490
What’s wrong?

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:03.410
Kin-chan?

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:05.940
Irie! Chris is badly hurt! Help her!

00:05:05.940 --> 00:05:08.160
Calm down. Tell me what happened.

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:11.120
Her leg was scalded by the hot tempura oil.

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:14.180
That’s bad! We have to call
for an ambulance now!

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:16.590
It’ll be faster to take her to our hospital.

00:05:16.590 --> 00:05:17.120
Let’s go!

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:21.690
The dermis was burned causing blisters.

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:26.630
She will be in a lot of pain, so I recommend admitting her to monitor her progress.

00:05:27.820 --> 00:05:31.380
If she gets admitted, will you be able to successfully heal her wound?

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:36.130
Judging by the condition, there’s a possibility of scarring.

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:39.770
Plastic surgery may be needed to restore the appearance.

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:43.330
It’ll be fine.

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:45.860
Dr. Nishigaki is highly acclaimed.

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:49.140
That’s true... But, the scarring...

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:51.340
You won’t know until you see the progress, right?

00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:52.510
She...

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:55.580
Chris isn’t even married yet.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:58.490
But, you’ll be the one to marry her, right?

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:01.100
What are you saying?

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:03.620
Then, you’re giving her away
to some other man?

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:06.460
I...

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:08.950
...won’t do that either.

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:10.100
What did you say?

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:14.930
I said, I won’t do that either!

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:17.190
I’m going.

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:18.220
Kinnosuke!

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:19.910
Don’t procrastinate!

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:23.660
Chris, does it still hurt?

00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:26.730
The medication is working, so I’m fine.

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:29.260
That’s good.

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:31.860
But, Kin-chan was really great
earlier, wasn’t he?

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:34.080
He really cherishes you, doesn’t he?

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:36.460
Does he, really?

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:37.330
Chris!

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:39.060
Kinnosuke!

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:43.670
Chris...

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:45.650
Will you...

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:48.420
What’s the matter?

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:50.510
Will you marry me?

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:52.010
Kin-chan!

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:56.810
I can’t do that.

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:59.750
What did you just say?

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:02.190
I can’t marry you, Kinnosuke.

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:04.580
What the...?!

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:07.440
How can you back out like it was nothing?

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:11.160
Yes, I no longer have the right to.

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:13.540
What right?

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:16.380
This was written in a book;

00:07:16.380 --> 00:07:21.620
Yamato Nadeshiko couldn’t marry without a body completely free of scars.

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:25.880
Are you stupid or something? I don’t give a damn about those burns!

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:28.370
With or without scars, you are still you!

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:30.130
Kinnosuke...

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:32.510
What a wonderful proposal!

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:35.510
Come on, Chris! Hurry and jump into Kin-chan’s arms!

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:38.290
I really can’t.

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:40.940
Why?

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:44.160
I don’t want your sympathy.

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:46.230
It’s because you’re such a kind person...

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:48.950
...you thought you had to look after me, right?

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:50.110
That’s not true!

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:55.730
I’m sure you don’t really love me.

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:59.600
It’ll be too painful for me if you married me due to sympathy.

00:08:00.090 --> 00:08:04.810
Idiot. In that case, would you believe me if I became the same as you?

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:09.060
Kin-chan, what are you planning to do?

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:10.250
That’s boiling water.

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:11.760
I’m going to be just like Chris.

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:13.850
I’m going to have the same burn marks as her.

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.220
What are you saying? Stop!

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:17.830
You’re in my way! Move aside!

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:21.320
Irie-kun! Hurry and stop him!

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:23.810
Kinnosuke! Don’t be stupid!

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:26.950
Kinnosuke! That’s enough!

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:28.640
That’s enough!

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:30.230
Can’t breathe...

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:34.150
The truth is I was so happy!

00:08:34.150 --> 00:08:39.720
However, I just suddenly felt insecure, when I thought about whether I’m deserving of you.

00:08:40.440 --> 00:08:43.120
Do you think I could forever devote myself to someone on sympathy alone?

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:47.220
Kinnosuke.

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:48.330
What is it?

00:08:48.330 --> 00:08:50.550
Propose to me again?

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:53.340
I want to give you a proper reply!

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:56.450
Man, you’re really hopeless.

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:59.310
Here goes. Marry me, Chris!

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:03.200
Yes, Kinnosuke! I love you lots and lots!

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:07.410
Well done! Congratulations!

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:11.730
It was really amazing!

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:14.540
Kin-chan was so passionate!

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:16.990
Haven’t you repeated the same thing often enough already?

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:20.820
But, I’m glad he’s managed to find a good wife.

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:23.500
Getting married is part of being a mature artisan.

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:26.370
Chris-san would make a great daughter.

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:28.750
And yet you were making fun of her when she visited us last time.

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:30.090
Making fun?

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:31.420
I wonder what you’re talking about.

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:34.420
What are you doing?

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:35.670
Sorry.

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:37.980
What is it?

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:40.010
This really is for the best, isn’t it?

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:44.390
Because, both you and Chris-san have found your most ideal partners.

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:46.570
Ideal is a bit much...

00:09:46.570 --> 00:09:48.400
Hurry and bring a dish cloth.

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:49.400
Okay.

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:54.840
Hey, your phone is ringing.

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:02.910
Naoki, what’s the matter?

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:05.570
Irie-kun, I’ve brought more coffee.

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:07.000
Irie-kun?

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:11.310
Keita? What’s up?

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:12.520
The report?

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:16.970
I thought that you might have forgotten that the submission date was changed to tomorrow.

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:19.510
Don’t worry, I remember.

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:21.810
I see. That’s good then.

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:24.570
Did you call me just for that? Thanks.

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:25.220
No...

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:28.290
Kotoko.

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:33.230
That thing I said before; I was serious.

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:35.740
Good night.

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:55.590
Really, thank you for your care.

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:59.270
It’s a good thing there wasn’t much scarring.

00:10:59.270 --> 00:11:01.300
That’s because of you, Doctor.

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:05.050
Irie, thank you for referring us to such a good doctor.

00:11:05.050 --> 00:11:06.930
Chris!

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:09.400
Congratulations on your discharge!

00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:12.040
These are lovely! Thanks.

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:13.810
Thank goodness I made it on time.

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:15.150
Sorry about this, Kotoko.

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:16.220
Shall we get going?

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:17.020
Sure.

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:18.370
Watch your step.

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:19.860
Her husband is so kind.

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:21.970
She actually said husband.

00:11:21.970 --> 00:11:23.810
That’s right.

00:11:23.810 --> 00:11:25.880
You’re going to get married, right?

00:11:25.880 --> 00:11:30.780
Yes, I’d love for us to become a wonderful couple just like you and Naoki.

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:33.270
We aren’t such...

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:36.370
I have a class to get to.

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:37.630
I’ll be going now.

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:40.820
Irie!

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:43.630
Are you free tonight?

00:11:45.610 --> 00:11:47.600
Here, eat up!

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:49.130
This is rather extravagant.

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:51.240
This is thanks for your help.

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:55.020
You helped her get admitted
among other things.

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:59.090
But, good for you Kinnosuke.
You didn’t get rejected this time.

00:11:59.090 --> 00:12:03.150
I wish I was there to hear your passionate marriage proposal too.

00:12:03.150 --> 00:12:05.080
Shut up and get back to work!

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:08.410
Your proposal was certainly a wee bit embarrassing though.

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:09.780
Leave me alone!

00:12:09.780 --> 00:12:11.240
But...

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:14.230
That was the first time I thought you acted really cool.

00:12:15.300 --> 00:12:20.050
The absence of rationality isn’t necessarily a weakness.

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:21.730
What the heck is that?

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:24.050
Are you praising or insulting me?
Say it clearly!

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:26.560
I’m praising you.

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:31.200
Are things with Kotoko going well?

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:39.470
I don’t know myself.

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:42.400
I don’t know why I’m acting that way towards Kotoko.

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:46.410
Even the genius has things
that he doesn’t know.

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:52.500
Since that Kamogari fellow has shown up, I just feel strangely irritated every time I look at her.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:53.730
You’re...

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:56.060
You really don’t know?

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:56.910
Know what?

00:12:56.910 --> 00:12:59.000
You’re just being jealous.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.350
Jealous?

00:13:00.890 --> 00:13:02.010
Me?

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:07.860
Listen here! Because of you, I’ve become a veteran of jealousy with five years experience!

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:09.680
Because I’m saying it, it can’t be wrong!

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:13.430
You’re jealous of Kotoko and that guy!

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:18.190
The genius is actually suffering from jealousy.

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:20.810
Jealousy?

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:28.630
Oh, you’ve started living on your own, Tomoko?

00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:31.290
Yeah, why don’t you all come visit next time?

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.990
The commute to school must be easy since it’s just a station away.

00:13:33.990 --> 00:13:36.290
That neighborhood is great too, isn’t it?

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:37.750
It is!

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:39.820
There’s a huge park in the neighborhood.

00:13:39.820 --> 00:13:42.270
And the hydrangeas there are very pretty right now.

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:46.880
That’s the park where I rode in a boat with Irie-kun.

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:50.470
Oh, the one famous for couples breaking up if they ride there.

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:53.640
I’m sure that’s just a silly superstition.

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:56.670
That would be an optimal situation for you.

00:13:56.670 --> 00:13:59.470
Huh? What are you talking about? Ridiculous.

00:13:59.470 --> 00:14:01.020
Oh, really?

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:05.900
Irie-kun.

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:07.480
Can I have a moment?

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:12.280
Want to go out this Sunday?

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:15.910
Remember the park where we rode on the boat?

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:18.970
I heard that the hydrangeas are really pretty there right now.

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:21.050
So, would you like to go together...?

00:14:21.050 --> 00:14:23.490
I’m busy preparing for an academic meeting.

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:26.710
I see.

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:28.090
Is that all?

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:33.430
Sorry for interrupting your studies.

00:14:45.180 --> 00:14:46.780
Kotoko? Hey.

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:49.200
This isn’t how it’s supposed to be!

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:54.520
What are you doing? Stop it!

00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:56.290
This isn’t how it’s supposed to be!

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:59.250
You don’t look at me any more. I’ve had it!

00:14:59.250 --> 00:14:59.750
Kotoko!

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:03.800
Keita thinks more of me!

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:07.170
He told me that he was serious.

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:09.120
He said that you don’t love me!

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:11.380
What he said was right!

00:15:11.380 --> 00:15:13.890
You don’t care about me at all!

00:15:16.670 --> 00:15:17.860
Calm down.

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:19.660
I’ve had enough.

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:23.940
I’ve had enough of this one-sided love!

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:27.320
Kotoko!

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:34.560
It’s over.

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:37.040
That feeling I always felt
somewhere in my heart...

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:40.770
The one I pretended not to see out of fear...

00:15:40.770 --> 00:15:42.790
I finally let it out.

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:46.090
Coming!

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:49.390
Kotoko-san, what’s the matter?

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:53.100
I came to visit, really.

00:15:56.090 --> 00:15:57.170
Kotoko-san?

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:01.300
Okay, I understand. Sorry about this.

00:16:01.300 --> 00:16:03.900
Please take care of Kotoko-chan.

00:16:04.910 --> 00:16:07.320
It seems like she’s at Tomoko-san’s place.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:09.110
She’ll be staying overnight there.

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:13.720
Really? Anyhow, it’s good that we know where she is.

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:16.070
Sheesh, she loves to make people worry.

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:18.290
I apologize for the worry she has caused.

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:23.220
No, it’s Onii-chan’s fault
that this has happened.

00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:25.790
Make sure you go fetch her tomorrow, okay?

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:31.300
Thank you all for coming.

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:33.450
I was so surprised!

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:34.520
Running from home!

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:37.260
This room is a big surprise as well.

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:39.770
I was trying to keep it at a moderate level too.

00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:42.950
Anyway, let’s drink tonight.

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:45.360
Yeah, let’s drink!

00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:47.850
Back when it was a one-sided love...

00:16:47.850 --> 00:16:52.950
...I thought that being able to look at him was more than enough.

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:56.280
But, now I want him to look at me more.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:58.430
I’ve become more and more demanding.

00:16:58.430 --> 00:17:00.120
That’s only natural if you love him.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:04.480
But, in the end, it’ll remain a one-sided love, won’t it?

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:07.130
This kind of marriage is really strange, isn’t it?

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:09.920
Have more faith in him.

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:14.330
He chose you, and not someone else.

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:20.340
She sleeps with such a cute look.

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:24.400
I think I sorta understand how Keita feels.

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:31.760
Naoki-kun, can I have a moment?

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:37.280
I used to have a lot of quarrels with my wife too when I was young.

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:39.580
She’s also ran away from home before.

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:40.870
Really?

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:44.200
I felt nostalgic after thinking about the past.

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:46.780
And I took this out of the closet.

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:50.460
Kotoko?

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:51.840
They look alike, don’t they?

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:53.900
That’s her mother.

00:17:53.900 --> 00:17:56.090
They do look alike.

00:17:56.390 --> 00:17:57.850
Ah, this.

00:17:57.850 --> 00:17:59.800
That’s the first time she cooked.

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:02.180
She really is very much like Kotoko.

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:05.350
She was terrible at cooking
and was such a klutz.

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:08.230
But to me, she was the best wife a man could ask for.

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:13.610
I was still an apprentice then, so I had no time for leisure.

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:18.770
But, when I was with her, I could return to my true self.

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:22.790
True self...

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:28.230
My head hurts.

00:18:28.230 --> 00:18:30.710
From that small amount of alcohol?
How pathetic.

00:18:31.070 --> 00:18:31.990
Here.

00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:35.400
This is the best cure.

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:37.420
Thanks.

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:40.680
I heard you ran away from home?

00:18:43.290 --> 00:18:44.360
Would you like to stay with me?

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:48.520
It’s a small place, but I should be able to manage one more.

00:18:49.460 --> 00:18:51.440
Keita, what are you saying?

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:54.440
I told you before that I was serious, right?

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:55.660
Keita?

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:59.030
Kotoko, I love you.

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.560
But, I’m Irie-kun’s...

00:19:02.560 --> 00:19:04.590
Did he come after you?

00:19:06.850 --> 00:19:08.920
As I thought.

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:12.520
He’s never done anything for you before.

00:19:12.520 --> 00:19:15.360
He’s aware of my presence, yet his facial expression doesn’t change.

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:16.340
You’re wrong!

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:18.570
Irie-kun!

00:19:18.570 --> 00:19:20.110
You’re completely wrong!

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:25.320
What’s the point of coming now?

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:27.920
You’ve worried the hell out of Kotoko.

00:19:27.920 --> 00:19:29.810
You can’t make her happy.

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:32.310
That might be true.

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:34.900
It’s not “might be”! It’s a fact!

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:36.280
Look, you were...!

00:19:36.280 --> 00:19:37.900
...jealous.

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:40.610
I was jealous of you.

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:47.700
Up until now, I’d never experienced jealousy or sadness.

00:19:48.340 --> 00:19:50.910
But, ever since you appeared...

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:55.120
...I was thrown about by those feelings buried within me.

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:58.110
What the hell is that?
I don’t get what you mean.

00:19:58.110 --> 00:19:59.190
I didn’t think you would.

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:00.380
Are you trying to pick a fight?!

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:03.400
I know another guy just like you.

00:20:04.130 --> 00:20:06.700
It was like he didn’t care about rationality.

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:09.890
He was so completely ruled by his emotions that it was pathetic.

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:13.020
I realized after watching him.

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:16.900
That, this was what it was like
to live as a human.

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:20.720
You’ll be able to live true to yourself as you are right now.

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:26.000
But, I can only be true to myself when I have Kotoko by my side.

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:27.120
Irie-kun...

00:20:27.770 --> 00:20:30.600
That’s why you don’t need Kotoko.

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:32.250
I’m the one who needs her.

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:35.460
Is it all right for me to be by your side?

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:37.670
I just said so, didn’t I?

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:45.510
I’ll never... I’ll never let you go
until the day I die.

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:47.510
I’m prepared for it.

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:48.670
Congratulations!

00:20:48.670 --> 00:20:49.640
I’m so envious!

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:51.020
We’ll pray for your happiness!

00:20:59.990 --> 00:21:01.290
What are you doing?

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:05.910
Look what you’ve done.
You’ve just made their bond deeper.

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:11.100
You thought of saving Kotoko
from her misery...

00:21:11.100 --> 00:21:13.900
...and that was all, Keita.

00:21:14.280 --> 00:21:16.500
We’ll just leave it as that then.

00:21:20.100 --> 00:21:23.670
I want to hurry back home and see everyone’s smiles.

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:27.340
And when we’re alone together later...

00:21:27.340 --> 00:21:31.440
...let’s have great kisses to make up for all the kisses we’ve missed.

00:21:31.440 --> 00:21:33.740
Let’s kiss lots and lots, okay?

00:23:07.450 --> 00:23:09.940
We’re finally going to have our capping ceremony.

00:23:09.940 --> 00:23:13.280
Tradition has it we’ll receive flowers from the male medical students.

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:16.120
That means I’ll be receiving flowers from Irie-kun?

00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:20.710
But last year, Irie-san turned down all the nursing events.

00:23:20.710 --> 00:23:22.880
I’m Irie-kun’s wife though!

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:24.380
There’s no way he can refuse.

00:23:26.150 --> 00:23:28.140
Next time on Itazura na Kiss:

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:30.170
The Nightingale Pledge.

00:23:30.170 --> 00:23:32.580
We’re definitely gonna be happy.
